# Character Creator

## Spec
See `docs/CHARACTER-CREATION-SCREEN-SPEC.md` and `docs/CREATOR-VIEWER-STATE-MANAGEMENT.md`.

## Edit 2D vs 3D
- **Default:** Edit 3D (paint on model)
- **3D mode:** Left-drag = paint, right-drag = orbit
- **2D mode:** Large canvas; 3D preview moves to creator panel (256px)
- **OrbitControls:** Recreate when switching back to 3D (dispose + new instance)
- **Camera reset:** When entering 2D preview, re-center camera (0, 1.5, 4)

## Brush
- Sizes: 1, 2, 4, 8 px (square block)
- Default: 2 px
- Custom box-outline cursor matching brush size

## Undo
- Command stack; point-based for brush strokes
- Load skin = push load command onto undo stack

## Layer Mask
- Drawing restricted to selected layer regions only
- Non-selected regions: dimmed or read-only
